{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3608020/extras/text.gif?t=1747618432\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The New Home of Trade, Strategy, and Adventure: Trade Tycoon Life Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your shop in the city, master the art of negotiation, and grow wealthy with strategic decisions! Keep an eye on the material offers coming from every corner of the city; everything from household goods to industrial products is on the table. Buying these goods at the best price and reselling them can make you a successful businessman... or maybe get you lost in a warehouse battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Negotiation and Trade:</strong> Negotiate with customers to buy materials and resell them for high profit. Maximize your earnings with the right decisions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Warehouse Battles:</strong> Compete in strategic warehouse battles with rivals to gain materials and power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shop and Vehicle Development:</strong> Use your earnings to grow your shop, add new products, and buy vehicles to expand your business.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Extra Activities:</strong> Besides trading, you can embark on different adventures like fishing, courier work, and more in the city.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your intellect and strategy to survive in the business world. Discover how powerful and rich you can become in the city. But remember, everyone is trying to take one more step towards the same goal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready? Trade Tycoon Life Simulator is waiting for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3608020?t=1747618432","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.st